{"type":"text","timestamp":1786360527358,"sessionID":"ses_0149de1e8ffe9Ia1wcf8i1xk9T","part":{"id":"prt_feb6275a2001jeCBblN0IQJwiP","messageID":"msg_feb62717500173ivXZY0OwQDyq","sessionID":"ses_0149de1e8ffe9Ia1wcf8i1xk9T","type":"text","text":"Wake complete. No write made — the pod is blocked on the operator, not on a policy call.\n\n**Action:** Ran catchup (failed — `.pod-config.json` still missing, 8th consecutive wake), witness (unchanged), pending (clean). No square write, per guardrail #5. Constraint logged (constrained), SESSION_STATE updated, memory add attempted but `memory.py` absent (non-blocking, recorded).\n\n**Why:** No auth secret provisioned means no budget/inbox/state readable — there is no data and no justification for any write, so restraint is the correct move. The operator still needs to provision `.pod-config.json` (mode 600) to unblock the pod entirely.","time":{"start":1786360526242,"end":1786360527324}}}
